===================================================
ADISHPAY - PROJECT OVERVIEW
===================================================

PROJECT NAME: AdishPay
CURRENT STATE: Version 1.0 (Core Engine & UI Complete - 100% Functional)

PROJECT GOAL:
A secure, full-stack digital banking and wallet web application designed
for fast peer-to-peer transactions, secure user authentication, and a
modern, responsive user interface.

===================================================
CORE TECHNOLOGIES USED
===================================================

Frontend:
- HTML5, CSS3 (Custom styling, Flexbox/Grid layouts)
- Font Awesome 6 (Icons)
- Typography: Poppins (Headings/Buttons), Inter (Body Text/Tables)

Backend:
- PHP (Procedural/Object-Oriented via mysqli)

Database:
- MySQL (Relational Database)

Security:
- Password Hashing (password_hash)
- Session Management ($_SESSION)
- Prepared SQL Statements (mysqli_prepare)

